{"candidateAnswer":"France","evidence":"[D1:8 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Jolene: Staying connected is super important. Do you have something to remember her by? This pendant reminds me of my mother, she gave it to me in 2010  in Paris.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3b0205f0-6aa2-59d2-b264-9fe17fbca42a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d0f0c1e7a51690d1ec447a9c893baf07dd375c9d2b5b97e81ccf5f42e917606b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"In what country did Jolene's mother buy her the pendant?","referenceAnswer":"In France","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d0f0c1e7a51690d1ec447a9c893baf07dd375c9d2b5b97e81ccf5f42e917606b"}}]}